<title>UK: DepFa sets 100 mln mark rex-linked bond.</title>
<headline>DepFa sets 100 mln mark rex-linked bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager DG Bank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   DEUTSCHE PFANDBRIEF- UND HYPOTHEKENBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    100 MLN DEM   COUPON    *4.70	MATURITY    05.MAR.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STEP-UP   ISS PRICE  102.40    PAY DATE    05.MAR.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.50	LISTING    FFURT     DENOMS (K)  10</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    1.00	SELL CONC  1.50</p>
<p> NOTES     *IN YEAR ONE THEN 81 PERCENT OF THE 10 YEAR REX</p>
<p>		SUB-INDEX THEREAFTER.</p>
<p>		OEFENTLICHE PFANDBRIEF NO. 438</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
